What:		/proc/jank_info/cpu_jank_info/top_hotthread
Date:		September 2026
KernelVersion:	4.14.357-openela-miru-h40
Contact:	KAI-Miru kernel maintainers
Description:
		Read-only ColorOS 14 CPU-jank hot-thread history.  The file emits
		32 lines, newest 128 ms window first.  Each populated line contains
		at most five records separated by two spaces.  A record uses the
		donor field grammar:

		uid$tgid$leader_comm$pid$comm$top_app_samples$other_samples

		On Miru H.40 the producer samples the current task on each online
		CPU from bounded delayed work.  Sampling is inactive by default and
		is armed only while the existing CPU-jank monitor or active-grab
		control is enabled.  The implementation uses 64 static history
		windows and 32 candidates per window; it adds no scheduler hook,
		per-task field, or dynamic allocation in the sampling path.
Users:		ColorOS performance diagnostics compatible with the OnePlus 9R
		Android 14 CPU-jank ABI.
